  "translation": "His head shines with the restless, creeper-like waves of the <b>heavenly river</b>, whirling round and round in the cauldron of his matted locks. On his broad forehead a <b>fire</b> blazes, <i>dhagad dhagad dhagad</i>. He wears the <b>young crescent moon</b> as his crest. May my delight be in him every moment.",
